  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 prose-nm">
    <p>
      I welcome applications from motivated students interested in paleoclimate science and
      environmental data science. Through the Paleoclimate Dynamics Laboratory at Northern Arizona
      University, I offer opportunities for graduate students and postdoctoral researchers to
      engage in cutting-edge research. <strong>Three funded PhD positions are currently open</strong>,
